= The Beer Hall Putsch

On the night of 8 November, Adolf Hitler and General Ludendorff proclaim a national revolution in a Munich beer hall. The next day police fire on their march at the Feldherrnhalle. The putsch collapses and Hitler is arrested.

The far right has failed too. For now.
